{"ID":"20240118151016-cbgdlyu","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118151016-cbgdlyu","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151016-cbgdlyu\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151016-09o0wt6\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122152623-70zpkdy\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122152623-70zpkdy\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:184,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:184\u0026#125;","title":"283白敛","type":"doc","updated":"20240204095613"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118151016-09o0wt6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118151016-09o0wt6","updated":"20240122152608"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】味苦，平，无毒。治痈肿，疽，疮，散结气，止痛，除热，目中赤，小儿惊痫，温疟，女子阴中肿痛。生山谷。一名莬核，一名白草。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122152612-en3ldv5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122152612-en3ldv5"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【产地】产我国湖南湖北，及北地各省亦多有之，根入药。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122152614-n507coa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122152614-n507coa"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【性味】味苦，性平，无毒。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122152615-bgq7cdp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122152615-bgq7cdp"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【主治】白敛主散结聚，治痈疽疮毒，痔瘘血痢，生肌止痛，外用敷一切疮，并治面上粉刺赤鼻。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122152617-bzf7k30","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122152617-bzf7k30"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【别录】杀火毒。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122152618-tixu2wq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122152618-tixu2wq"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【大明】治发背瘰疬，面上疱疮，肠风痔瘘，血痢，刀箭疮扑损，生肌止痛。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122152620-88o9957","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122152620-88o9957"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【用量】普通五分至钱半。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122152622-66njpnd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122152622-66njpnd"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【禁忌】反乌头。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122152622-w8vqril","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122152622-w8vqril"}},{"ID":"20240122152622-n8vy1qg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122152622-n8vy1qg"}},{"ID":"20240122152622-kzi3n0p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122152622-kzi3n0p"}},{"ID":"20240122152623-70zpkdy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122152623-70zpkdy","updated":"20240204095613"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"283白敛，本经原文：白敛味苦，平，无毒。诸位看主治，白敛专门主散结聚，脓块，脓肿。白敛也是比较强的药，那个痔疮，痔肉，拉肚子，生肌止痛，外用，像我们那个外用，外敷的药粉里面都有。治疗面上的粉刺还有赤鼻，就是那个酒糟鼻、红鼻子嘛，这个最主要是去化脓的，皮肤啊，你看【大明】说：治发背瘰疬，脸上的泡疮，肠风痔漏，血痔，刀箭的伤，外科在使用白敛。你看，白敛长的这个样子。"}]}]}